: "1066255965785441", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1066255969118774_5061235754950637975_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WtoX_sd-VE0Q7kNvwFsxYJi&_nc_oc=AdqVPK6xjHdNum2v3rNflJLR3NEWTWTfTbxHZ_9nHZ-O0iN_dlV1jXTXwWQxM1UGGJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLDClNJQoMRomBpfxvmYwxqV-Uc8_MGzjrGrt6sC1P4vA&oe=6AB539CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumb_1.png", "id": "2197161320857639", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_2197161324190972_6772736704629114966_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l1a6lHUXhEgQ7kNvwEQs_DB&_nc_oc=Adqgkno2rHBCc28JEU5ciqTHioerXBcTyPycpQ5bLLoBmRrROLM4v4KWfV6VOFsJAz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJToSc0FZEqV2KHdHH2nbLFoygZW2yuZuhlnNwyrNlT4Q&oe=6AB535CC"}, "display_name": "Drug Dealing Simulator VR", "keywords": ["Drug", "Dealing", "Simulator", "Skateboard", "Schedule"], "long_description": "Travel around the town on your skateboard, **Rob people for money**, offer them **Free drugs**, hustle around the city, **Fight or escape cops**, **Grow weed/coca plants**, **Cook meth and Cocaine**, do chemical **Mixing**, **Invest** in properties, play in **Casino** or just do **Trash picking jobs**. The world is limitless\ud83c\udf3f\n{1610729873749072}\n# Ride around on your skateboard and organize your house and warehouse \ud83c\udfed\n{1410693714288820}\n# Plant seeds and water and harvest cannabis and coca trees. Run the lab to cook meth and process cocaine. Also, upgrade the lab to a warehouse with superior seeds and mixing for higher profits \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\udd2c\n{2128372754728929}\n# Increase your profit margins by extending your product with a variety of chemical additives and watch your customers react to your custom batches\ud83e\uddea\n{2141976119716074}\n\n\n{2478301776004449}\n\n\n- Find your Customers by **offering Free Drugs**\n